# P3 queries: RWI options (skip, hit-last, pierceable hits, sorting, foreign-data skip, flags),
# PWI (static and swept box/sphere/capsule/cylinder), RayTraceEntity, CollideEntityWithPrimitive,
# CollideEntityWithBeam on a small static world.
